# Line endings are content here.
#
# This is a Windows toolkit: .ps1 / .bat / .cmd / .vbs files are CRLF on disk and several of
# them are byte-sensitive (scheduled-task command lines, batch labels). Git is therefore told
# not to normalise anything (`-text`), so a clone on any platform yields byte-identical files
# and no phantom "whole file changed" diffs.
#
# Binary assets are marked explicitly for storage/diff purposes.

* -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
